# The controller may decline to sacrifice another enchantment (CR 603.1).
[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald x2
Enigmatic Incarnation
Fang of Shigeki
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
